(6156828, 907851, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the edge of light along the boy''s back and head.  I''d love to see this in b/w.</td>', 'Love the edge of light along the boy''s back and head.  I''d love to see this in b/w.', '2010-09-08 19:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
