(6157134, 908148, 63244, '<td valign="top">Comment only. Not voting.<br/>Love the similarities of the woman and the artwork. Red shirt, red nail polish, red cloth. Obvious, skinny black jeans, skinny black frame simple subject matter. This is very appealing and very simple, yet...complicated. Love the tilt which just adds to the elements. Great eye to see this.</td>', 'Comment only. Not voting.Love the similarities of the woman and the artwork. Red shirt, red nail polish, red cloth. Obvious, skinny black jeans, skinny black frame simple subject matter. This is very appealing and very simple, yet...complicated. Love the tilt which just adds to the elements. Great eye to see this.', '2010-09-09 00:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157136, 908064, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love the intense colors and the fact you can see the heat and the fumes from the Mig! Composition and color are excellent. Such an interesting capture imho.</td>', 'Love the intense colors and the fact you can see the heat and the fumes from the Mig! Composition and color are excellent. Such an interesting capture imho.', '2010-09-09 00:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
