(6157174, 908216, 114450, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.</td>', 'This is beautiful.', '2010-09-09 01:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157176, 907067, 114450, '<td valign="top">wow... amazing.</td>', 'wow... amazing.', '2010-09-09 01:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157268, 908084, 30364, '<td valign="top">This was so <i>nearly</i> brilliant  I so rarely do this because I think it''s insufferably presumptuous, but alas I''m going to do it anyway.  The bottom 25% diminishes the photograph.  It begged, pleaded, howled, wheedled and entreated for a squarish crop from the top, ending just at the guy''s right knee (his actual knee not his shadow knee).  I never saw a picture that could not be improved by the addition of a little implication and ambiguity.  Well, hardly ever.  <br/> <br/>Having blurted all that probably unwelcome bile upon you, let me say I still make it my pick as clear best of the challenge, although I''m still rolling the bottom bit off my screen as I savour it.</td>', 'This was so nearly brilliant  I so rarely do this because I think it''s insufferably presumptuous, but alas I''m going to do it anyway.  The bottom 25% diminishes the photograph.  It begged, pleaded, howled, wheedled and entreated for a squarish crop from the top, ending just at the guy''s right knee (his actual knee not his shadow knee).  I never saw a picture that could not be improved by the addition of a little implication and ambiguity.  Well, hardly ever.   Having blurted all that probably unwelcome bile upon you, let me say I still make it my pick as clear best of the challenge, although I''m still rolling the bottom bit off my screen as I savour it.', '2010-09-09 07:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157463, 908276, 113278, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots you will remember. Not real sure what is going on but hey, it meets the challenge and is done well.</td>', 'This is one of those shots you will remember. Not real sure what is going on but hey, it meets the challenge and is done well.', '2010-09-09 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157468, 908122, 113278, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to have far too much empty space. Is the man on the balcony suppose to be the subject or the lady at the bottom? There is really nothing to lead me through the shot either. I think a tight crop on the gentleman at the top would have been a much stronger composition. As it is it seems like it was a misfire of the camera.</td>', 'This shot seems to have far too much empty space. Is the man on the balcony suppose to be the subject or the lady at the bottom? There is really nothing to lead me through the shot either. I think a tight crop on the gentleman at the top would have been a much stronger composition. As it is it seems like it was a misfire of the camera.', '2010-09-09 12:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157473, 908303, 113278, '<td valign="top">The deck and the bystanders and the sky are excellent but then I get drawn to the ground and it is not good at all.I am guessing you did some strong processing to make the sky very dramatic but it overdid the ground and looks off. Perhaps cropping out the ground would of helped, that or if this was advanced editing you could of masked the ground. As is it is a stunning image and would be a favorite of mine if it wasn''t for the bottom of the photo. 6</td>', 'The deck and the bystanders and the sky are excellent but then I get drawn to the ground and it is not good at all.I am guessing you did some strong processing to make the sky very dramatic but it overdid the ground and looks off. Perhaps cropping out the ground would of helped, that or if this was advanced editing you could of masked the ground. As is it is a stunning image and would be a favorite of mine if it wasn''t for the bottom of the photo. 6', '2010-09-09 12:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157476, 908207, 113278, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice here is that the image seems a bit soft. I would guess that is from using a lower shutter speed due to the dark enviroment. The color also seems off but that may just be me as I have never been in any caves. I do like the silhouette but then he really isn''t observing any action and your title even confirms that. Sorry but most I can do here is a 4.</td>', 'The first thing I notice here is that the image seems a bit soft. I would guess that is from using a lower shutter speed due to the dark enviroment. The color also seems off but that may just be me as I have never been in any caves. I do like the silhouette but then he really isn''t observing any action and your title even confirms that. Sorry but most I can do here is a 4.', '2010-09-09 12:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157482, 908156, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice image overall here. I would of preferred a different composition perhaps with the main subject to one of the lower thirds and leave just one of the boats in the frame. The sky is very blown out but short of advanced editing or a gradient ND filter that is tough to overcome. The black line on the sail seems out of place as well, almost seems like something hanging in front of the camera. But all in all a nice entry.</td>', 'Nice image overall here. I would of preferred a different composition perhaps with the main subject to one of the lower thirds and leave just one of the boats in the frame. The sky is very blown out but short of advanced editing or a gradient ND filter that is tough to overcome. The black line on the sail seems out of place as well, almost seems like something hanging in front of the camera. But all in all a nice entry.', '2010-09-09 12:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157490, 908259, 113278, '<td valign="top">Something with the processing here seems off but I can''t quite place it. I also would of liked to see the horses doing something but that is just me. Maybe if you could of used a lower aperture to throw the horses oof and put more focus on the lady, I think that wouldhelp to create a stronger image.</td>', 'Something with the processing here seems off but I can''t quite place it. I also would of liked to see the horses doing something but that is just me. Maybe if you could of used a lower aperture to throw the horses oof and put more focus on the lady, I think that wouldhelp to create a stronger image.', '2010-09-09 12:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157495, 907801, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here and use of bokeh. My only real issue is that the blurred players in the background seem a bit off with the way they are processed. Did you use a lot of topaz or similar to bring out the detail in the main subjects? Pretty nicely done though.</td>', 'Nice composition here and use of bokeh. My only real issue is that the blurred players in the background seem a bit off with the way they are processed. Did you use a lot of topaz or similar to bring out the detail in the main subjects? Pretty nicely done though.', '2010-09-09 12:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157628, 908064, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is great!  It''s perfect that he''s wearing red so he stands out more. Nice work</td>', 'Wow, this is great!  It''s perfect that he''s wearing red so he stands out more. Nice work', '2010-09-09 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157630, 908273, 38930, '<td valign="top">It fits the challenge, nice work.  Next time I''d say ditch the bike seat because it''s a tad distracting.</td>', 'It fits the challenge, nice work.  Next time I''d say ditch the bike seat because it''s a tad distracting.', '2010-09-09 16:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157631, 908148, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice!  The colors are great, and I''m not even bothered by the tilted horizon because 1) she''s vertical, and 2) it''s an art studio so things are "different" there anyways :)</td>', 'Nice!  The colors are great, and I''m not even bothered by the tilted horizon because 1) she''s vertical, and 2) it''s an art studio so things are "different" there anyways :)', '2010-09-09 16:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157632, 907546, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice title - I like how you also have the action in the photo too</td>', 'Nice title - I like how you also have the action in the photo too', '2010-09-09 16:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157633, 907756, 38930, '<td valign="top">This is great!  The sign is a little distracting, but other than that a photo like this could be used as an advertisement.</td>', 'This is great!  The sign is a little distracting, but other than that a photo like this could be used as an advertisement.', '2010-09-09 16:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157635, 907972, 38930, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  It''s cool that your depth of field is just enough so we can make out that it''s a band.</td>', 'Great shot!  It''s cool that your depth of field is just enough so we can make out that it''s a band.', '2010-09-09 16:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
