(6157640, 908259, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - it fits the challenge perfectly</td>', 'Nice shot - it fits the challenge perfectly', '2010-09-09 16:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157641, 908084, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a really cool perspective!  I visit this place all the time and I really like how you shot something different</td>', 'Wow, this is a really cool perspective!  I visit this place all the time and I really like how you shot something different', '2010-09-09 16:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157649, 908212, 118248, '<td valign="top">The referee is never "Innocent". I would have like it better with a little fewer white jerseys.</td>', 'The referee is never "Innocent". I would have like it better with a little fewer white jerseys.', '2010-09-09 16:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157651, 907851, 118248, '<td valign="top">I really the subject. It is almost as if the little boy is pretending he is on a rearing horse.</td>', 'I really the subject. It is almost as if the little boy is pretending he is on a rearing horse.', '2010-09-09 16:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157652, 907788, 118248, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the focus on the man in the wheelchair "The Bystander" or a more shallow field to pull out the short boy who is glancing over at the old man.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the focus on the man in the wheelchair "The Bystander" or a more shallow field to pull out the short boy who is glancing over at the old man.', '2010-09-09 16:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157653, 908276, 118248, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on the boys face. I would have liked to seen a different angle on this one. It takes a second to locate the boy for me. I think my eye is drawn away from him because the angle of the tree is moving away from him.</td>', 'Love the expression on the boys face. I would have liked to seen a different angle on this one. It takes a second to locate the boy for me. I think my eye is drawn away from him because the angle of the tree is moving away from him.', '2010-09-09 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157654, 907581, 118248, '<td valign="top">Like the angle and contrast on this one. Man''s head and cap definitely draws me to action, the little kid playing chess. I think a better title would have been "Rook to D5".</td>', 'Like the angle and contrast on this one. Man''s head and cap definitely draws me to action, the little kid playing chess. I think a better title would have been "Rook to D5".', '2010-09-09 16:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157655, 908273, 118248, '<td valign="top">Very attractive lady but the lady with glasses on her head sniffing the bike seat is distracting. Maybe a different angle would have been better.</td>', 'Very attractive lady but the lady with glasses on her head sniffing the bike seat is distracting. Maybe a different angle would have been better.', '2010-09-09 16:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157656, 908202, 118248, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field but maybe a slight angling to the left would have been better. Knocking out the green can on the step and putting some air behind the boys rearend and shoe. He looks stuck to something.</td>', 'I like the depth of field but maybe a slight angling to the left would have been better. Knocking out the green can on the step and putting some air behind the boys rearend and shoe. He looks stuck to something.', '2010-09-09 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157659, 907512, 118248, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition. I feel it displays socioeconomic separatism at its worst. Hopefully, this is not the case but if you were trying to make such a statement, this would nail it on the head. The 3 girls hugging look like uniformed private school students while the girl who is left out looks as though she definitely is not. This is my definition of "Innocent" bystander.</td>', 'I really like this composition. I feel it displays socioeconomic separatism at its worst. Hopefully, this is not the case but if you were trying to make such a statement, this would nail it on the head. The 3 girls hugging look like uniformed private school students while the girl who is left out looks as though she definitely is not. This is my definition of "Innocent" bystander.', '2010-09-09 16:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157770, 907937, 23484, '<td valign="top">Lots of bystanders.</td>', 'Lots of bystanders.', '2010-09-09 19:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6157771, 907972, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good dof.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good dof.', '2010-09-09 19:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
