(6157862, 907536, 117314, '<td valign="top">Nice concept for the challenge. But the image is too blurry. The focus seems to be on the fence? thing and not on the dog.</td>', 'Nice concept for the challenge. But the image is too blurry. The focus seems to be on the fence? thing and not on the dog.', '2010-09-09 21:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
