(6161448, 907546, 106806, '<td valign="top">first impression is not a particularly good picuture colour and treatment wise etc but must say you can really really feel the lad watching the game ... pretty impressive</td>', 'first impression is not a particularly good picuture colour and treatment wise etc but must say you can really really feel the lad watching the game ... pretty impressive', '2010-09-14 06:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161620, 908276, 103411, '<td valign="top">WTF is this... is that dude wearing a bra?  Nice legs.  Grin on the kid is priceless.</td>', 'WTF is this... is that dude wearing a bra?  Nice legs.  Grin on the kid is priceless.', '2010-09-14 12:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161624, 908148, 103411, '<td valign="top">I actually really like the tilt here, her stance makes it work.</td>', 'I actually really like the tilt here, her stance makes it work.', '2010-09-14 12:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161625, 908068, 103411, '<td valign="top">I can''t quit figure out what is going on here.... but I can''t stop looking at it.</td>', 'I can''t quit figure out what is going on here.... but I can''t stop looking at it.', '2010-09-14 12:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161665, 907968, 113278, '<td valign="top">I get where you are going with this but the image is very blurry and soft. It also appears that the ref isn''t even watching the action.</td>', 'I get where you are going with this but the image is very blurry and soft. It also appears that the ref isn''t even watching the action.', '2010-09-14 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161668, 907571, 113278, '<td valign="top">You may get a lot of low votes on this from the processing but I really like this style and I think you did it very well. There does seem to be just a bit much going on in the shot and it is on the verge of being too busy but I like it. 9</td>', 'You may get a lot of low votes on this from the processing but I really like this style and I think you did it very well. There does seem to be just a bit much going on in the shot and it is on the verge of being too busy but I like it. 9', '2010-09-14 13:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161669, 907489, 113278, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to figure out what this was, and I am still not sure. I would like to actually see the subject better for this challenge and the color seems almost too saturated. I do like how the wave has a nice flow to it and how it seems to wrap itself around the setting sun.</td>', 'It took me a minute to figure out what this was, and I am still not sure. I would like to actually see the subject better for this challenge and the color seems almost too saturated. I do like how the wave has a nice flow to it and how it seems to wrap itself around the setting sun.', '2010-09-14 13:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161670, 907581, 113278, '<td valign="top">Really well done, I love the B&amp;W treatment and how the kid is nicely blurred but you can still see what the man is observing.</td>', 'Really well done, I love the B&W treatment and how the kid is nicely blurred but you can still see what the man is observing.', '2010-09-14 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161671, 907512, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice capture here. I like how it is telling a bit of a story. I think I would prefer a different crop though to really throw focus on the girls.</td>', 'Nice capture here. I like how it is telling a bit of a story. I think I would prefer a different crop though to really throw focus on the girls.', '2010-09-14 13:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161672, 907739, 113278, '<td valign="top">Really nice. Great processing, nice framing and meets the challenge well. I really like this.</td>', 'Really nice. Great processing, nice framing and meets the challenge well. I really like this.', '2010-09-14 13:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161673, 907536, 113278, '<td valign="top">Kinda shows that it is not an "innocent" bystander eh? This isn''t bad but it really seems more like a normal everyday family photo. It just doesn''t do it for me, sorry.</td>', 'Kinda shows that it is not an "innocent" bystander eh? This isn''t bad but it really seems more like a normal everyday family photo. It just doesn''t do it for me, sorry.', '2010-09-14 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161675, 907586, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice work here. Love the center composition on this one and even though they don''t seem to be witnessing anything really exciting it is a lovely image.</td>', 'Nice work here. Love the center composition on this one and even though they don''t seem to be witnessing anything really exciting it is a lovely image.', '2010-09-14 13:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161677, 908308, 113278, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but I feel as though it fails to meet the challenge. What is she observing? Where is the action, implied or otherwise?</td>', 'I like this a lot but I feel as though it fails to meet the challenge. What is she observing? Where is the action, implied or otherwise?', '2010-09-14 13:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161679, 908007, 113278, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of the processing here but I love the story. Now can we say cats are ever innocent though??</td>', 'I am not a fan of the processing here but I love the story. Now can we say cats are ever innocent though??', '2010-09-14 13:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161680, 907756, 113278, '<td valign="top">Well he is not very innocent if he is standing next to a sign that says no standing now is he? I think this meets the challenge well but it just seems to be lacking any impact, at least for me.</td>', 'Well he is not very innocent if he is standing next to a sign that says no standing now is he? I think this meets the challenge well but it just seems to be lacking any impact, at least for me.', '2010-09-14 13:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161681, 907937, 113278, '<td valign="top">Whoa, lots of bystanders in this one. The crowd works well here and I love the framing and old time processing. Good luck.</td>', 'Whoa, lots of bystanders in this one. The crowd works well here and I love the framing and old time processing. Good luck.', '2010-09-14 13:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161683, 907972, 113278, '<td valign="top">Love this, don''t think it needs the border though. Love the framing and blur and the story. Meets the challenge well and is well done.</td>', 'Love this, don''t think it needs the border though. Love the framing and blur and the story. Meets the challenge well and is well done.', '2010-09-14 13:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161684, 907985, 113278, '<td valign="top">So how innocent is he?? Great lighting and composition. Nice entry.</td>', 'So how innocent is he?? Great lighting and composition. Nice entry.', '2010-09-14 13:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161685, 907974, 113278, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge well enough but it just seems to be missing something. Sadly this is an image I will likely soon forget.</td>', 'This meets the challenge well enough but it just seems to be missing something. Sadly this is an image I will likely soon forget.', '2010-09-14 13:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161687, 907546, 113278, '<td valign="top">I do not really like the processing here but I like that you focused on the bystander. It seems as though there are some halos around the kids, Topaz or similar?</td>', 'I do not really like the processing here but I like that you focused on the bystander. It seems as though there are some halos around the kids, Topaz or similar?', '2010-09-14 13:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161691, 908168, 113278, '<td valign="top">Love the processing and reflection here. And I love how you chosse to be the action that the bystander is watching, nice.</td>', 'Love the processing and reflection here. And I love how you chosse to be the action that the bystander is watching, nice.', '2010-09-14 13:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161694, 908020, 113278, '<td valign="top">Great work. Love the color and the framing and the crashing waves and the bystanders watching. Good work.</td>', 'Great work. Love the color and the framing and the crashing waves and the bystanders watching. Good work.', '2010-09-14 13:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161697, 908190, 113278, '<td valign="top">This seems to be missing a bystander or action but will give you the benefit of the doubt. I love the action you captured but I actually think I would prefer this without the mother in the frame.</td>', 'This seems to be missing a bystander or action but will give you the benefit of the doubt. I love the action you captured but I actually think I would prefer this without the mother in the frame.', '2010-09-14 13:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161705, 907795, 113278, '<td valign="top">Sorry but there just doesn''t seem to be anything grabbing my attention and drawing my eyes in. It really just seems like a quick family vacation, documentation style picture.</td>', 'Sorry but there just doesn''t seem to be anything grabbing my attention and drawing my eyes in. It really just seems like a quick family vacation, documentation style picture.', '2010-09-14 13:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161707, 908104, 113278, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this just seems a bit soft and out of focus. And there really doesn''t seem to be any impied or otherwise action that anyone is observing.</td>', 'Sorry but this just seems a bit soft and out of focus. And there really doesn''t seem to be any impied or otherwise action that anyone is observing.', '2010-09-14 13:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161725, 907244, 112292, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite shot of this challenge. You captured a very expressive look. 9</td>', 'One of my favorite shot of this challenge. You captured a very expressive look. 9', '2010-09-14 13:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161726, 907434, 112292, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I like the expression of these faces.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I like the expression of these faces.', '2010-09-14 13:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161728, 907415, 112292, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice shot. One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2010-09-14 13:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161730, 908303, 112292, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky.</td>', 'Wonderful sky.', '2010-09-14 13:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161738, 908020, 112292, '<td valign="top">Wow. I like the silhouettes of  lighthouse and people.</td>', 'Wow. I like the silhouettes of  lighthouse and people.', '2010-09-14 13:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161796, 907489, 120171, '<td valign="top">The blue for me, love it all.</td>', 'The blue for me, love it all.', '2010-09-14 14:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162002, 908148, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice find.  I really like how her eyes are covered by her hair and her nose is just peeking out to mimic the photo.  I like the red matching and her contemplative stance.  But based on your frame, the feeling of the photo is extremely claustrophobic for me...so I actually don''t enjoy looking at it...perhaps it was your intent to make the viewer uncomfortable.  But I obviously find it intriguing to some degree, so nice work.  I''m curious how other people receive this, as for me it is probably one of the more interesting examples of innocent bystander in the collection (not that i haven''t seen my fill of odd juxtapositions at museums...don''t feel bad...i''m guilty too  ;) ),  yet the cropping off of the photo and the odd angle is very un-dpc. best of luck in all your photo endeavors. -9</td>', 'nice find.  I really like how her eyes are covered by her hair and her nose is just peeking out to mimic the photo.  I like the red matching and her contemplative stance.  But based on your frame, the feeling of the photo is extremely claustrophobic for me...so I actually don''t enjoy looking at it...perhaps it was your intent to make the viewer uncomfortable.  But I obviously find it intriguing to some degree, so nice work.  I''m curious how other people receive this, as for me it is probably one of the more interesting examples of innocent bystander in the collection (not that i haven''t seen my fill of odd juxtapositions at museums...don''t feel bad...i''m guilty too  ;) ),  yet the cropping off of the photo and the odd angle is very un-dpc. best of luck in all your photo endeavors. -9', '2010-09-14 18:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162004, 908272, 13688, '<td valign="top">very innocent bystander like...though I''m not understanding who can''t wait and for what...but that''s ok I''m kinda slow and wasn''t super popular in high school :( - 8</td>', 'very innocent bystander like...though I''m not understanding who can''t wait and for what...but that''s ok I''m kinda slow and wasn''t super popular in high school :( - 8', '2010-09-14 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162005, 908208, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice find.  I wish you got around the tree and focused on the poodle behind the victim. -8</td>', 'nice find.  I wish you got around the tree and focused on the poodle behind the victim. -8', '2010-09-14 18:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162017, 908084, 13688, '<td valign="top">I hope to get a telegram from an agent in Hollywood someday too ;)  I''m not sure of your intent, which i suppose is intriguing in and of itself as i like to try to understand what people are thinking. So I''ll pretend I''m the innocent bystander watching you drive your hyundai into a pack of unexpectant DPC GTG''ers - 9</td>', 'I hope to get a telegram from an agent in Hollywood someday too ;)  I''m not sure of your intent, which i suppose is intriguing in and of itself as i like to try to understand what people are thinking. So I''ll pretend I''m the innocent bystander watching you drive your hyundai into a pack of unexpectant DPC GTG''ers - 9', '2010-09-14 18:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162021, 908303, 13688, '<td valign="top">Hey... your title reminded me of a Letters to Cleo song I hadn''t heard in 10 years...Big Star...though it starts ''There it goes again...''  ...so I''m not sure why.  Anyway, the sky is very ominous.  The lighting on the people on the deck is interesting.  I wish I could see the people better (i know they probably wouldn''t be bystanders anymore) and could better associate the storm to a metaphor of life. -8</td>', 'Hey... your title reminded me of a Letters to Cleo song I hadn''t heard in 10 years...Big Star...though it starts ''There it goes again...''  ...so I''m not sure why.  Anyway, the sky is very ominous.  The lighting on the people on the deck is interesting.  I wish I could see the people better (i know they probably wouldn''t be bystanders anymore) and could better associate the storm to a metaphor of life. -8', '2010-09-14 19:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162042, 908258, 120171, '<td valign="top">Top 3 for me, great shot.</td>', 'Top 3 for me, great shot.', '2010-09-14 19:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
