(6162302, 908276, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not the kind of shot I would expect from you and an HM for a shot that I would not have expected to do this well. The humor factor counted for a lot. Either that, or it''s just that DrAchoo Photo-Mojo! Well seen. (It got a 7 from me, BTW)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-15 00:10:55.</i></td>', 'Not the kind of shot I would expect from you and an HM for a shot that I would not have expected to do this well. The humor factor counted for a lot. Either that, or it''s just that DrAchoo Photo-Mojo! Well seen. (It got a 7 from me, BTW)', '2010-09-15 01:10:17.000000', '2010-09-15 01:10:55.000000', 0),
(6162303, 907067, 50695, '<td valign="top">I only gave you a 7 because I thought this was just a picture of an art exhibit, but now that I know it''s you, I''m not so sure.</td>', 'I only gave you a 7 because I thought this was just a picture of an art exhibit, but now that I know it''s you, I''m not so sure.', '2010-09-15 01:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
