(6162448, 907415, 105890, '<td valign="top">Wow wow woow :) Im so excited! Thanks to everyone for the comments. <br/>I have to admit that i was lucky to be in the right place at the right time. It was Formula1 event organised by Red Bull just infront of my office windoweses, in the center of town, Vilnius, Lithuania. Yes, its eastern Europe and people were damn curious and creative to see David Kulhard racing so they were climbing on <a href="//www.efoto.lt/files/images/30878/viewers-13.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">buildings</a>, cars, fences, i even saw 2 guys sitting on <a href="//www.efoto.lt/files/images/30878/viewers-15.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">toilet cabin</a> just to get a better view.<br/>In this shot people are standing on abandond car parking building. I was just leaving the office and was shocked to see "layers" of people.<br/>You can take a look at more pictures from this event <a href="//www.efoto.lt/node/482478" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here.</a> <br/>Once more - thanks everyone, glad that you enjoyed it. Its such a cool feeling to get a first ribbon especially a blue one :)</td>', 'Wow wow woow :) Im so excited! Thanks to everyone for the comments. I have to admit that i was lucky to be in the right place at the right time. It was Formula1 event organised by Red Bull just infront of my office windoweses, in the center of town, Vilnius, Lithuania. Yes, its eastern Europe and people were damn curious and creative to see David Kulhard racing so they were climbing on buildings, cars, fences, i even saw 2 guys sitting on toilet cabin just to get a better view.In this shot people are standing on abandond car parking building. I was just leaving the office and was shocked to see "layers" of people.You can take a look at more pictures from this event here. Once more - thanks everyone, glad that you enjoyed it. Its such a cool feeling to get a first ribbon especially a blue one :)', '2010-09-15 03:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6162449, 907586, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice catch Dale. congrats on a high placement with a 6+ score. <br/>by the way, your shot reminded me <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=407474" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a></td>', 'nice catch Dale. congrats on a high placement with a 6+ score. by the way, your shot reminded me this', '2010-09-15 03:41:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6162451, 907985, 119179, '<td valign="top">Wooow !!!! How could I have expected to get a ribbon !!! I''m so happy !<br/>Thanks everyone for the great comments, the favs, and of course for the score !!!<br/> <br/>This is actually a selfportrait (I''m still a beginner photographer and find it hard to work with a model... Hope I''ll manage someday). <br/>I thought that using the blinds would be a nice way to meet the challenge. I always love the light effects created by them on pictures. Just needed some sun (hard to find in the UK !!), a few shots to get a good face with a kind of emotion, a bit a postprocessing, and job done !!!<br/> <br/>Sooooo happy !!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-15 03:49:43.</i></td>', 'Wooow !!!! How could I have expected to get a ribbon !!! I''m so happy !Thanks everyone for the great comments, the favs, and of course for the score !!! This is actually a selfportrait (I''m still a beginner photographer and find it hard to work with a model... Hope I''ll manage someday). I thought that using the blinds would be a nice way to meet the challenge. I always love the light effects created by them on pictures. Just needed some sun (hard to find in the UK !!), a few shots to get a good face with a kind of emotion, a bit a postprocessing, and job done !!! Sooooo happy !!!', '2010-09-15 03:45:11.000000', '2010-09-15 04:49:43.000000', 0),
